"""DGP6 supervised runner (derived from run_dgp5.py) (protocol rule 4): every arm executes from a CLEAN DETACHED CHECKOUT at the frozen commit (--code-root), with the worker's cwd set to that checkout, source identity checked at launch and at completion
(sha256 of the planner / engine / kernel / construction files vs FREEZE.json), outputs under the records tree. Arms (brief section 6): BASE (accepted integrated.py with run_paired.FROZEN options), REPAIRED (unified_pac_planner v0.10 --lifted --envelope RMAX: the nine repairs + the
common primary-probe / protection policy; no direct proposal), SEED (--lifted --envelope RMAX --global seed), GLOBAL (--lifted --envelope RMAX --global global); diagnostic pseudo-arms OLD_POLICY_REPAIRED (--lifted --envelope RMAX --old-policy), G0_GLOBAL / CAP_ONLY / MOMENT_ONLY (--global g0_global|cap_only|moment_only),
FORCED_SEED / FORCED_GLOBAL (--force-stream global --global seed|global; the optional-role risk delta / 4; never completions). Sample seed per task: first eight SHA-256 bytes of 'DGP6-SAMPLE|<model_sha256>|<k>' (unsigned big-endian) reduced to 1..2^31-1 (k = 0 primary, 1 / 2 confirmations), shared across arms.
Primary arm order rotated by the model hash (first eight hex digits mod the arm count); reversed for confirmations. Contracts: main 20.0 / 19.5 / 19.0 (supervisor ceiling 24); p4 4.0 / 3.85 / 3.5 (ceiling 6); p20 = main. Input paths resolve through dgp_paths (packet-relative / DGP_ROOTS; sha256-checked).
usage: run_dgp6.py SUBDIR MANIFEST.json --code-root /path/to/detached --arms BASE,REPAIRED,SEED,GLOBAL --contract main|p4|p20 [--confirm --seed-index K] [--only a,b] [--scope S] [--records RD] [--amendment F] [--skip-existing]"""
import sys, os, json, time, subprocess, argparse, hashlib
sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))
RD_DEFAULT = '/Users/adis/Workspace/pgm-records/code/runs/mdi_2026-10-28/DGP6_GLOBAL_CONSTRUCTION'; SUP_CODE = os.environ.get('PGM_CODE', '/Users/adis/Workspace/pgm/code'); PY = os.environ.get('PY', os.path.join(SUP_CODE, '.venv/bin/python')); CAFF = os.environ.get('CAFF', '/usr/bin/caffeinate')
CONTRACTS = dict(main=dict(outer=20.0, hard=19.5, work=19.0, ceiling=24.0), p4=dict(outer=4.0, hard=3.85, work=3.5, ceiling=6.0), p20=dict(outer=20.0, hard=19.5, work=19.0, ceiling=24.0))
